<title>USA: U.S. meat output 0.7 pct above a week ago - USDA.</title>
<headline>U.S. meat output 0.7 pct above a week ago - USDA.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1997-08-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Red meat production for week ending Saturday, August 16, 821.4 million lbs, up 0.7 pct. - USDA</p>
<p>WEEK ENDING/1  BEEF   CALF/VEAL   PORK/2  LAMB/MUTTON  TOTALS/3</p>
<p>16-Aug-97     495.0	5.5	 316.7	 4.2	 821.4</p>
<p>09-Aug-97     502.1	6.3	 302.9	 4.3	 815.6</p>
<p>Change:	  -1.4%   -12.7%	  4.6%     -2.3%	  0.7%</p>
<p>17-Aug-96     501.7	6.9	 312.9	 4.5	 826.0</p>
<p>Change:	  -1.3%   -20.3%	  1.2%     -6.7%	 -0.6%</p>
